  "version": "1",
  "text": "You will shine in this look: the deep purple sequined dress sets a festive tone while the soft pink coat adds warmth for the frosty air. The brown suede bag grounds your silhouette, and the brown leather boots keep you comfortable on any dance floor. Together, they balance warmth and elegance, perfect for an upscale New Year’s gathering.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Wear the coat open over the dress to show off the shimmering fabric and elongate your figure",
    "Keep the bag in front of you so it feels like a natural extension of the outfit, not clutter",
    "Let the boots wrap snugly around your ankle to maintain a clean, vertical line that draws attention upward"
  ],
